<title>USA: Nat'l Picture sees Q2 EPS below estimates.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Picture sees Q2 EPS below estimates.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWOOD, Miss. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Picture &amp; Frame Co said Monday it expects its second quarter earnings to be in the range of $0.28 to $0.30, falling short of analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected the picture frame manufacturer to earn $0.31 to $0.33 per share, up from $0.29 a share last year.</p>
<p>National Picture expects second quarter net sales of about $18.8 million, up from last year's net sales of $17.8 million.</p>
</text>
